# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale ru
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as утро [04:00, 12:00).
# Surface: the instrumental adverb "утром" ("in the morning"), the form these
# deictic phrases use ("сегодня утром", "вчера утром").
# Source: Wiktionary, "утром" (adverb, instrumental of утро)
# https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/утром
утром
